s is the week to drive two or three back to back and ask the honest question about each. Straight answers are the whole model. The coffee is hot and nobody works on commission pressure.",1]]],[1793307461,1809118661],null,[3,"https://www.motorinnautogroup.com/used-inventory","Buy",3,1],null,"7785693274940949903","14730652758503817758",["https://www.google.com/search?sca_esv\u003d404a6062959aa475\u0026authuser\u003d0\u0026hl\u003den\u0026gl\u003dus\u0026output\u003dsearch\u0026ie\u003dUTF-8\u0026q\u003dMotor+Inn+Toyota+and+Chevrolet+of+Carroll\u0026ludocid\u003d9445609159222270316\u0026lpsid\u003dCIHM0ogKEIGq8avkgIiVzwE\u0026ibp\u003dgwp;0,10#lpstate\u003dpid:CIHM0ogKEIGq8avkgIiVzwE,ar","/gmb/local_post/accounts%2F115596490921363748880%2Flocations%2F14730652758503817758%2FlocalPosts%2F7785693274940949903/version/1793307461455000","https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCI-Lg_iH2ZWGbBIXQ0lITTBvZ0tFSUdxOGF2a2dJaVZ6d0UaE0Nnd0l4ZWFPMXdZUXdObUNvQUk\u0026d\u003d286732320\u0026t\u003d20"],"https://search.google.com/local/posts?q\u003dMotor+Inn+Toyota+and+Chevrolet+of+Carroll\u0026ludocid\u003d9445609159222270316\u0026lpsid\u003dCIHM0ogKEIGq8avkgIiVzwE\u0026source\u003dsh/x/loc/post\u0026lsig\u003dAB86z5X0s5GV0fB3sjymwOf0xNoK","2ahUKEwjYz7uX9Z6YAxVWN4YAHVOBEWsQ544CKC16BQgAEIcB",null,"Oct 29, 2026",null,null,1,null,null,"https://business.google.com/mm/posts/l/u14730652758503817758/delete?s\u003dEAA%3D\u0026ih\u003dtactile\u0026p\u003dChM3Nzg1NjkzMjc0OTQwOTQ5OTAz","https://business.google.com/mm/posts/l/u14730652758503817758/edit?s\u003dEAA%3D\u0026ih\u003dtactile\u0026p\u003dChM3Nzg1NjkzMjc0OTQwOTQ5OTAz",null,null,null,null,null,["7785693274940949903","CIHM0ogKEIGq8avkgIiVzwE","CgwIxeaO1wYQwNmCoAI"],null,null,"https://www.google.com/local/business/14730652758503817758/promote/updates/7785693274940949903/edit"],[null,[[["Rut season runs through November, and so does the deer movement at dusk — the two weeks before Thanksgiving are historically the busiest for road crossings in our part of Iowa. Stopping distance is the part of the vehicle that matters most right now. If the brakes have been humming, grabbing, or stretching longer than they used to, the check takes minutes: pads, rotors, and fluid, shown to you on the actual parts. Plenty of pads have months left, and we will tell you when they do. The ones that do not, we fix the same day, before the highway trip or the next dusk drive.",1]]],[1793307461,1809118660],null,[11,null,"Call now",11,2,[null,["(712) 792-5000",null,"","+17127925000",null,["tel:+17127925000",null,null,"2ahUKEwjYz7uX9Z6YAxVWN4YAHVOBEWsQ_doBKAF6BQgAEIoB"]]]],null,"8065488482850609615","14730652758503817758",["https://www.google.com/search?sca_esv\u003d404a6062959aa475\u0026authuser\u003d0\u0026hl\u003den\u0026gl\u003dus\u0026output\u003dsearch\u0026ie\u003dUTF-8\u0026q\u003dMotor+Inn+Toyota+and+Chevrolet+of+Carroll\u0026ludocid\u003d9445609159222270316\u0026lpsid\u003dCIHM0ogKENqi_7Dtv_7GHg\u0026ibp\u003dgwp;0,10#lpstate\u003dpid:CIHM0ogKENqi_7Dtv_7GHg,ar","/gmb/local_post/accounts%2F115596490921363748880%2Flocations%2F14730652758503817758%2FlocalPosts%2F8065488482850609615/version/1793307460879000","https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCM-zwsKt4Zf3bxIWQ0lITTBvZ0tFTnFpXzdEdHZfN0dIZxoSQ2dzSXhlYU8xd1lROFBteEVR\u0026d\u003d286732320\u0026t\u003d20"],"https://search.google.com/local/posts?q\u003dMotor+Inn+Toyota+and+Chevrolet+of+Carroll\u0026ludocid\u003d9445609159222270316\u0026lpsid\u003dCIHM0ogKENqi_7Dtv_7GHg\u0026source\u003dsh/x/loc/post\u0026lsig\u003dAB86z5X0s5GV0fB3sjymwOf0xNoK","2ahUKEwjYz7uX9Z6YAxVWN4YAHVOBEWsQ544CKC56BQgAEIgB",null,"Oct 29, 2026",null,null,1,null,null,"https://business.google.com/mm/posts/l/u14730652758503817758/delete?s\u003dEAA%3D\u0026ih\u003dtactile\u0026p\u003dChM4MDY1NDg4NDgyODUwNjA5NjE1","https://business.google.com/mm/posts/l/u14730652758503817758/edit?s\u003dEAA%3D\u0026ih\u003dtactile\u0026p\u003dChM4MDY1NDg4NDgyODUwNjA5NjE1",null,null,nul