ft on them, and we will tell you so. The ones that do not, we fix the same day.",1]]],[1792700439,1808511639],null,[11,null,"Call now",11,2,[null,["(712) 792-5000",null,"","+17127925000",null,["tel:+17127925000",null,null,"2ahUKEwjYz7uX9Z6YAxVWN4YAHVOBEWsQ_doBKAF6BQgAEJQB"]]]],null,"8528230964936812890","14730652758503817758",["https://www.google.com/search?sca_esv\u003d404a6062959aa475\u0026authuser\u003d0\u0026hl\u003den\u0026gl\u003dus\u0026output\u003dsearch\u0026ie\u003dUTF-8\u0026q\u003dMotor+Inn+Toyota+and+Chevrolet+of+Carroll\u0026ludocid\u003d9445609159222270316\u0026lpsid\u003dCIHM0ogKEIP46di2irOr7QE\u0026ibp\u003dgwp;0,10#lpstate\u003dpid:CIHM0ogKEIP46di2irOr7QE,ar","/gmb/local_post/accounts%2F115596490921363748880%2Flocations%2F14730652758503817758%2FlocalPosts%2F8528230964936812890/version/1792700439634000","https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCNrSrtyMnJetdhIXQ0lITTBvZ0tFSVA0NmRpMmlyT3I3UUUaE0Nnd0lsLURwMWdZUTJKaW83UUk\u0026d\u003d286732320\u0026t\u003d20"],"https://search.google.com/local/posts?q\u003dMotor+Inn+Toyota+and+Chevrolet+of+Carroll\u0026ludocid\u003d9445609159222270316\u0026lpsid\u003dCIHM0ogKEIP46di2irOr7QE\u0026source\u003dsh/x/loc/post\u0026lsig\u003dAB86z5X0s5GV0fB3sjymwOf0xNoK","2ahUKEwjYz7uX9Z6YAxVWN4YAHVOBEWsQ544CKDR6BQgAEJIB",null,"Oct 22, 2026",null,null,1,null,null,"https://business.google.com/mm/posts/l/u14730652758503817758/delete?s\u003dEAA%3D\u0026ih\u003dtactile\u0026p\u003dChM4NTI4MjMwOTY0OTM2ODEyODkw","https://business.google.com/mm/posts/l/u14730652758503817758/edit?s\u003dEAA%3D\u0026ih\u003dtactile\u0026p\u003dChM4NTI4MjMwOTY0OTM2ODEyODkw",null,null,null,null,null,["8528230964936812890","CIHM0ogKEIP46di2irOr7QE","CgwIl-Dp1gYQ2Jio7QI"],null,null,"https://www.google.com/local/business/14730652758503817758/promote/updates/8528230964936812890/edit"],[null,[[["Cold mornings are mechanical auditors. The battery that cranked fine at 50 degrees gets marginal at 20; a wiper blade that cleared the windshield in September smears in the first sleet; coolant mixed weak will slush exactly when you least want to park. None of these is a big repair if it is caught now. Our winter inspection covers battery load, wipers, coolant strength, tires, brakes, and defroster, and we hand you the findings on paper — fix what needs fixing now and schedule the rest. It is the cheapest tow you will never need. Carroll mornings do not ease into winter; they arrive.",1]]],[1792700439,1808511639],null,[1,"https://www.motorinnautogroup.com/service","Book",1,1],null,"9240929882036741","14730652758503817758",["https://www.google.com/search?sca_esv\u003d404a6062959aa475\u0026authuser\u003d0\u0026hl\u003den\u0026gl\u003dus\u0026output\u003dsearch\u0026ie\u003dUTF-8\u0026q\u003dMotor+Inn+Toyota+and+Chevrolet+of+Carroll\u0026ludocid\u003d9445609159222270316\u0026lpsid\u003dCIHM0ogKEIj1tuTXkOPJ5gE\u0026ibp\u003dgwp;0,10#lpstate\u003dpid:CIHM0ogKEIj1tuTXkOPJ5gE,ar","/gmb/local_post/accounts%2F115596490921363748880%2Flocations%2F14730652758503817758%2FlocalPosts%2F9240929882036741/version/1792700439023000","https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCIW0jbi6krUQEhdDSUhNMG9nS0VJajF0dVRYa09QSjVnRRoSQ2dzSWwtRHAxZ1lRb0pDUFVB\u0026d\u003d286732320\u0026t\u003d20"],"https://search.google.com/local/posts?q\u003dMotor+Inn+Toyota+and+Chevrolet+of+Carroll\u0026ludocid\u003d9445609159222270316\u0026lpsid\u003dCIHM0ogKEIj1tuTXkOPJ5gE\u0026source\u003dsh/x/loc/post\u0026lsig\u003dAB86z5X0s5GV0fB3sjymwOf0xNoK","2ahUKEwjYz7uX9Z6YAxVWN4YAHVOBEWsQ544CKDV6BQgAEJUB",null,"Oct 22, 2026",null,null,1,null,null,"https://business.google.com/mm/posts/l/u14730652758503817758/delete?s\u003dEAA%3D\u0026ih\u003dtactile\u0026p\u003dChA5MjQwOTI5ODgyMDM2NzQx","https://business.google.com/mm/posts/l/u14730652758503817758/edit?s\u003dEAA%3D\u0026ih\u003dtactile\u0026p\u003dChA5MjQwOTI5ODgyMDM2NzQx",null,null,null,null,null,["9240929882036741","CIHM0ogKEIj1tuTXkOPJ5gE","CgsIl-Dp1gYQoJCPUA"],null,null,"https://www.google